# ROS2 Spiral Turtle

A simple ROS2 turtlesim project where the turtle moves in an expanding spiral using velocity commands.

## Technologies
- ROS2 Humble
- Python
- turtlesim

## Run

```bash
ros2 run turtlesim turtlesim_node



In another terminal:

ros2 run spiral_turtle spiral

